:"https://github.com/openairinterface/oai-cn5g-amf.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/openairinterface/oai-cn5g-amf","homepage":"https://openairinterface.org/core-network/","size":15479,"stargazers_count":2,"watchers_count":2,"language":"C++","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":7,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":31,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"collaborators_only","topics":["openairinterface-cn5g"],"visibility":"public","forks":7,"open_issues":31,"watchers":2,"default_branch":"develop","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openairinterface/oai-cn5g-amf/pulls/27","html_url":"https://github.com/openairinterface/oai-cn5g-amf/pull/27","diff_url":"https://github.com/openairinterface/oai-cn5g-amf/pull/27.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/openairinterface/oai-cn5g-amf/pull/27.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-09T07:54:10Z"},"body":"Remove the AMF-side PDU session context when SMF selection fails during `NSMF_PDU_SESSION_CREATE_SM_CTX` handling.\r\n\r\n The create handler registers a `pdu_session_context` before SMF selection. If NRF lookup, NRF-based SMF discovery, or config-based SMF selection fails, the handler returns without removing that context.\r\n\r\n  Because no SMF learned about the session, SMF-driven cleanup can never release it. The stale context stays in the UE session map, and at de-registration the AMF waits on its release until timeout. Each survivor blocks `TASK_AMF_N1` for the full timeout, stalling NAS processing for other UEs.\r\n\r\n A related static-config case remains possible if SMF selection succeeds but the CreateSMContext request later fails or times out. That path is left for follow-up because cleanup after an ambiguous HTTP timeout could orphan SMF-side state.\r\n\r\nFixes: #18 ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openairinterface/oai-cn5g-amf/issues/27/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openairinterface/oai-cn5g-amf/issues/27/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":32512790489,"node_id":"AE_lADOTP-du88AAAABSQNTtc8AAAAHkenP2Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openairinterface/oai-cn5g-amf/issues/events/32512790489","actor":{"login":"sgarg00","id":239177960,"node_id":"U_kgDODkGQ6A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/239177960?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgarg00","html_url":"https://github.com/sgarg00","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgarg00/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgarg00/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgarg00/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgarg00/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgarg00/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgarg00/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgarg00/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgarg00/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgarg00/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"assigned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-10-05T13:37:35Z","assignee":{"login":"sgarg00","id":239177960,"node_id":"U_kgDODkGQ6A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/239177960?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgarg00","html_url":"https://github.com/sgarg00","followers_url":"https://api.github.c